# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Production tooling and biometric source material: never uploaded.
# A trainer decision of 6 Nov 2026 kept the whole narration workstream local. A
# second decision, of 9 Nov 2026, published the *rendered* narration and nothing
# else: the per-slide tracks, the full-length tracks and the subtitles now ship
# inside the course player, so a visitor can listen to the lesson. What still
# stays out is the recipe and the source — the voice samples, the synthesis
# command line, the build scripts and the run ledgers behind that audio. The
# rules below exist so that an accidental `git add -A` cannot republish any of
# it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/docs/tools/tts/

# Local sources of the published page: the player template, its data files, the
# checks and the package notice. The player is published as generated output
# under Formation-IA-Images-Videos-Marketing/course/, never from here.
**/build/course-site/
**/build/qc.mjs
**/build/README-package.txt

*.wav
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.aac
*.flac
*.ogg

# Partner archives: they carry the rendered media and exceed GitHub's 100 MB
# per-file limit. Distributed outside the repository.
*.zip

# Video: generated demos and any rendered media.
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
*.mkv

# Two scoped exceptions, each narrowed to one directory so that no other media
# file anywhere in the repository can be staged.
#
# 1. The practical-works pack versions its 47 demo extracts, so the workbook
#    plays exactly as it was verified. Largest clip 21,275,720 bytes, well under
#    GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit; 248,915,344 bytes for all 94 media files.
#    The poster stills are .jpg and were never excluded.
!Formation-IA-Images-Videos-Marketing/lab/assets/demos/media/*.mp4

# 2. The course player publishes the rendered narration, so a visitor can listen
#    to the lesson: one track per slide, the whole course in one piece, and the
#    subtitles, in each of French and English — 46 files for 258,790,368 bytes,
#    the largest 67,285,562, under the same 100 MB limit. The voice samples the
#    narration was cloned from are the biometric, and they stay out; publishing
#    the rendered audio does not publish them. The .srt and .png files beside it
#    were never excluded.
!Formation-IA-Images-Videos-Marketing/course/assets/audio/**/*.m4a

# Secrets — the CLI reads them outside the repository, never inside it.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.p12
api-key*
apikey*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Office and system files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.qoder-office-pptx-locks/
~$*
*.tmp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Working copy of the slide generator; only the deliverable is versioned.
**/build/pptx-work/

# Run logs and local backups.
*.log
*.bak

